      "english": "True enough.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5C58",
      "source_words_sha256": "96a02ae597fa6f5792e002ebc5d5e57097f431bb6820687df3eabbab43c97aba",
      "english": "By the way, know any beauties?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5C7C",
      "source_words_sha256": "c840b3a5d2212b712f6e5d8d1eeb6d008c5e47e22a47e612fb9ce2ea4d41b173",
      "english": "Right. Got it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5C90",
      "source_words_sha256": "539e0f214bc668154cbc652eea87d9f074b1aeb5c443bb9badf6737859b38b8d",
      "english": "Yamazaki? Something happened?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5CB0",
      "source_words_sha256": "7509e98b18462a8ad51b4ad732cd46bc559e3e65389e79f1ace0240e1a8e00f5",
      "english": "Might be urgent business.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5CD0",
      "source_words_sha256": "3806a375e9c10acbbb1cc295cf7b3aa96c3eafcf08e34b8f60e87ae7a263f4ff",
      "english": "Vice-Chief! Glad the chief's here too!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5D10",
      "source_words_sha256": "fc08c1ef551b8a0e4e74db2b2116d2256be0dd0a4d83dd4884e479043b43365f",
      "english": "No idea.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5D28",
      "source_words_sha256": "fb1978ac98a549a52eda74fb2b348b03aa875ce8088af9d59c33313629554f7c",
      "english": "Hmm... Can't think of anyone on the spot.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5E9C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4ebca1c36d484dcb115c754507d1b7c8b17249d3a07815ca0120820428a8d545",
      "english": "Yeah. Let's go.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5EBC",
      "source_words_sha256": "17a83f1323a9eeb0f4b1438ba6af5303442a468a75698d6db461db199904fa40",
      "english": "Don't know the shop.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5F00",
      "source_words_sha256": "14a0df7be14d2f9db9674f081c783ee66d7d9fad3e3784cdef6ba046c0a50788",
      "english": "!!!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5F0C",
      "source_words_sha256": "bc971bd0872653cc9314b07d0baabdbd1718c011a6c3660fb86171a48fd39a47",
      "english": "This is really gonna kill Toshi!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5F30",
      "source_words_sha256": "5b518a544501d503cc0b6c2603845dc57e00c6a63e2d27d025e8f8bef1d08618",
      "english": "It's all gone to hell!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F5FD0",
      "source_words_sha256": "24ff6b7f172db63528dec06ebc24280df49d6ea34e43da1b7ad3f01b2e8212ab",
      "english": "Ane? What kind of woman?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6020",
      "source_words_sha256": "826605ca33878043ea2ae63eb3c699a5f8626c594e47d6a2977db03cfe6d29b3",
      "english": "I said, a beauty. Dressed like a shrine maiden. You'll know her.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6064",
      "source_words_sha256": "3970b3db95bfab8aea16723bd50ff3b9d9edaedc198ce5e0a5033e43b739d5eb",
      "english": "What kind of woman?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F607C",
      "source_words_sha256": "91df5af14352fceb59734ec36a0ab973ae6bc36a2f7047da22d8d463b6f84467",
      "english": "A beauty... Did see one, come to think of it.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F60B8",
      "source_words_sha256": "6c51122d0a049d2b2557e1fc4447741f4a4993e65caefd6635b9244e0d3b0335",
      "english": "Long-haired girl, dressed like a shrine maiden.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F60EC",
      "source_words_sha256": "66bce020cf1a5093202fbfc1aa10bd23d0b4b7545c4972feb044278bb6404a4a",
      "english": "Went into the candy shop.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6110",
      "source_words_sha256": "0c6d360788732fa40a8e5c2d31b95f90281876faff6a81fd96aef0daa3db90eb",
      "english": "Seen a woman named Mone?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6158",
      "source_words_sha256": "b3f5ed30d8f0b6ce6f301a1a3099bced1c27658842ce642f91b3f2faca08c815",
      "english": "What kind of woman?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F616C",
      "source_words_sha256": "4bee20412288563b9147ce62588a3853c0a8db05c7125116944a5eb21db0dbb9",
      "english": "I see. That's why she was with Oryo.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F619C",
      "source_words_sha256": "b8b77e504d43cd17d827b4924def606acce4064440e50db33303688520179789",
      "english": "Ane and Oryo work at the same club.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F61C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "33a53d973ba07bf400f8957bff19f85a54874951d604185cff90768fb982d56d",
      "english": "Where did she go?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F61E4",
      "source_words_sha256": "37e591381b0060a40e98dc0fe252cd4d9ceb709ab8101081062f23320ad99e61",
      "english": "Candy shop, then!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F61F8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c8fa409195ede47f2c533901a5daf8aea096bc9e01def16e0b3868d2bba9da2a",
      "english": "After coming all this way...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F621C",
      "source_words_sha256": "e8b41c7c01158ac2cd7d28eeff8b76d4cdffc1765f561bf0573e289f7dcbb73b",
      "english": "Why?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F622C",
      "source_words_sha256": "5f965a34691ac275bad1e17e5c220e4ef16d591ab3158739df86d935b3bf0ba3",
      "english": "Know her sister too, then.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6254",
      "source_words_sha256": "cbf439b3d3a0d0feea37832f77e7cc20ac03e0d6598d0aa29483b6de22fb82f8",
      "english": "Hurry!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6260",
      "source_words_sha256": "393cdad182811e4adeb068bfb11cd4139e705568754c7d82a232d3139249efe3",
      "english": "Only know she's meant to be pretty...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6294",
      "source_words_sha256": "7bf6e1bec9f64765752a31df4b27f0f5cb01610d46a90909cc65da3b2ef2327d",
      "english": "Dressed like a shrine maiden? Maybe Ane's little sister?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F633C",
      "source_words_sha256": "8b986dc5e51bb7df68b97dd3dec81e8fffb2d9eeb7e8efa832c25417f4ae584b",
      "english": "Hey. This the underground Gin Tama battle venue?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6380",
      "source_words_sha256": "78da45d6756efdefd30adc7e32c7c58d595ebd94f2d35448abec68444bf259c7",
      "english": "It's fine, Kondo. I'll go alone.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F63A4",
      "source_words_sha256": "d053737c159428e7e032f0a9c6046a1ce910788410ae8e41a88a129add5f6dc4",
      "english": "Leave it to me. You and Sougo might just slow me down.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F63F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "2fe6333931d04fdf6350927924160af672087f0a8206232a9000f4194bd8e4ee",
      "english": "Not a kid. Leave him be... Well, I'm off.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6440",
      "source_words_sha256": "fe67fe117cc420d0f9eee4bf812207c0181ae5530637c9ec5f3da8a7696e17e3",
      "english": "Finally going in, Toshi?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F64AC",
      "source_words_sha256": "58584c931f45f14bcf3730575b0afd2b3ac2c3cb7cf2cf5f7747c4170733d3c0",
      "english": "Well, let's go, Toshi!",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F64C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "d30aa368b406398a4172565bc67983beb3bf953252276c8ed01029b7b1791e49",
      "english": "B-but...",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F64F4",
      "source_words_sha256": "be2d6effd37e11aa9412505acf4bae36d20c2fb1ecfa857299d71e424a3f1edb",
      "english": "How dare you! ...Huh? Wait. Where's Sougo...?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6650",
      "source_words_sha256": "78e6e4e9629b9529b0a2bc252ac33660d34b4d3c020ac72be27b1b8f39599722",
      "english": "Yeah. Failed last time. Won't happen again.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6688",
      "source_words_sha256": "130a659fdb6ba5e6c80a48386d26009d0eaac3eafcdb672eaafed7e24ab35de5",
      "english": "Leave him alone... Anyway, I'm going in.",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F66C8",
      "source_words_sha256": "c00f527f59ec0d9eaf1ae611f948af41e3d5c94731239de6a5041079c65ffa27",
      "english": "Hey... This pass gets me inside, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6708",
      "source_words_sha256": "02c233daece1be77c8f53869d8fd61700e276d5edecf0d2c6286c8e1f27f7e19",
      "english": "Going in after all, huh?",
      "translator_note": null
    },
    {
      "id": "msb_000F6724",
      "source_words_sha256": "e27d10b1a1d7c2fc6817d3fe523a984356fd172ed37fae77245bdc8431b224a5",
      "english": "Oh, the guard. Show him the pass, right?",
      "translator_note": null
    }
  ]
}
